.TH elfshaker-explode 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-explode \- Explodes a pack into loose objects
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker explode\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpack\-name\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Explodes a pack into loose objects
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose description of the execution process.
.TP
\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR [default: elfshaker_data]
Set the path to the elfshaker repository.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpack\-name\fR>
The name of the pack to explode.
